  "notes": "H6055 is the only BLE-only SKU (AbsBleSku) and the only battery SKU in hollowlamp. H60B3-like multi-zone and H6057 speaker features are documented per family. Scene/DIY catalogues are cloud-driven. straightfloorlamp uses cmdType 0xA3 for gradual change even though 0xA3 is also the multi-packet proType. No Matter/MQTT/LAN protocol in this split."
